{
  "$schema": "gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json",
  "productName": "Nora Desktop",
  "version": "0.2.5",
  "identifier": "com.nora.desktop",
  "build": {
    "beforeDevCommand": "npm run dev",
    "devUrl": "http://localhost:1420",
    "beforeBuildCommand": "npm run build",
    "frontendDist": "../dist"
  },
  "app": {
    "windows": [
      {
        "label": "main",
        "title": "Nora Desktop",
        "url": "https://nora.systems/dashboard",
        "width": 1200,
        "height": 800,
        "minWidth": 900,
        "minHeight": 600,
        "resizable": true,
        "fullscreen": false,
        "decorations": true,
        "backgroundColor": "#FDFDFC"
      },
      {
        "label": "overlay",
        "url": "overlay.html",
        "title": "Nora Live",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 600,
        "minWidth": 520,
        "minHeight": 280,
        "decorations": false,
        "transparent": true,
        "alwaysOnTop": true,
        "visible": false,
        "resizable": true,
        "skipTaskbar": true
      },
      {
        "label": "dock",
        "url": "dock.html",
        "title": "Nora Dock",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 56,
        "decorations": false,
        "transparent": true,
        "alwaysOnTop": true,
        "visible": false,
        "resizable": true,
        "skipTaskbar": true,
        "focus": false
      }
    ],
    "security": {
      "csp": null
    },
    "withGlobalTauri": true
  },
  "plugins": {
    "nora": {
      "apiBaseUrl": "http://localhost:8080",
      "sttBackend": "local",
      "whisperModel": "small"
    },
    "updater": {
      "endpoints": [
        "https://github.com/sys0xFF/nora/releases/latest/download/latest.json"
      ],
      "pubkey": "dW50cnVzdGVkIGNvbW1lbnQ6IG1pbmlzaWduIHB1YmxpYyBrZXk6IEUzMTRGRjNGNkEyNjgyNjYKUldSbWdpWnFQLzhVNDVQUmVydUQ3aWYzNFN6cER4eDJhOXAzd3E5MUNYMDdXNEk5cE8yMjh1UzMK",
      "windows": {
        "installMode": "passive"
      }
    }
  },
  "bundle": {
    "active": true,
    "targets": "all",
    "createUpdaterArtifacts": true,
    "icon": [
      "icons/32x32.png",
      "icons/128x128.png",
      "icons/128x128@2x.png",
      "icons/icon.icns",
      "icons/icon.ico"
    ],
    "macOS": {
      "//": [
        "11.0 e nao o default 10.13 do Tauri. O ggml do whisper.cpp (ADR 0035) usa",
        "std::filesystem, que a libc++ da Apple so expoe a partir do deployment target",
        "10.15 — com 10.13 o clang aborta com \"path is unavailable: introduced in",
        "macOS 10.15\" em ggml-backend-reg.cpp e o build script do whisper-rs-sys entra",
        "em panico.",
        "",
        "TEM que ser AQUI, nao no workflow: o `tauri build` EXPORTA",
        "MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET a partir deste campo, sobrescrevendo qualquer valor",
        "que o CI tenha setado no ambiente. Foi exatamente o que aconteceu no PR #358.",
        "",
        "11.0 e nao 10.15 porque o alvo e aarch64-apple-darwin e Apple Silicon nao",
        "existe antes do macOS 11 — nao estamos abrindo mao de compatibilidade real."
      ],
      "minimumSystemVersion": "11.0"
    }
  }
}
